 1	//! Rust port of `tests/test4.cpp`.
 2	//!
 3	//! Prints, one per line, the results of the four `idna` predicates applied to
 4	//! the domain given as the first command-line argument (defaulting to
 5	//! `example.com`).
 6	//!
 7	//! The library modules are pulled in by path so that this file builds both as
 8	//! the Cargo `test4` binary and standalone via `rustc test4.rs`.
 9	
